WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Your Dashboard is the org.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Departments and agents appear on the chart.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Open an agent to chat, attach files, and use tools you granted.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Workspace markdown and templates live here — Apply and Publish carefully.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Resync refreshes ORG and AGENTS files.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Chat is where work starts; Kanban and workflows are where it becomes durable.
